{"3180670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Undying Flower", "steam_appid": 3180670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3536940], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Undying Flower</i> is an atmospheric narrative journey through memory, grief, and the fragile moments that shape our lives. Players step into the fractured memories of a woman haunted by a tragic mistake, reliving moments from her past as reality twists into surreal landscapes shaped by guilt and regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As players move through these dreamlike spaces, they uncover hidden truths about the relationship between a granddaughter and her grandfather, slowly piecing together the events that led to a devastating loss. With every step deeper into memory, the question grows heavier:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/c00fe4c6598924e29bc9e01212dd2703.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/16bc056ad32add86656446ef273f6589.poster.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/16bc056ad32add86656446ef273f6589.webm?t=1782406632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey into the darkest memories of Nala, looking for a way to erase the trauma and regret through an experimental treatment. The Flower will guide you through to what you may need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/eca5de6a75257ed078404a20e6f532a5.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/2ec67e32c2c007417b8f79be05fa1bec.poster.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/2ec67e32c2c007417b8f79be05fa1bec.webm?t=1782406632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two sides to every coin. Two sides to every memory. Journey through shared memories of Nala and her late grandfather, piecing together the truth of what happened between them, the joy, the sorrow, and everything in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/ce8c52be8f754993a968ad9ad5b9ba66.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/d3cea6f30b64355da3a8c984f1e7069f.poster.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/d3cea6f30b64355da3a8c984f1e7069f.webm?t=1782406632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do you fix regret? How much will it take? The pieced-together truth may provide the solution. Or it might push Nala even further into despair, grappling with her guilt. The only way to know is to test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/2cf3d23b49f49f077d726f4c6856298c.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/af5c0b900368852093e2a9baa2212d91.poster.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/af5c0b900368852093e2a9baa2212d91.webm?t=1782406632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test. Test. Then test again. Change the variables. Change the answers. Find a way to erase the regret. Eventually.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Undying Flower</i> is an atmospheric narrative journey through memory, grief, and the fragile moments that shape our lives. Players step into the fractured memories of a woman haunted by a tragic mistake, reliving moments from her past as reality twists into surreal landscapes shaped by guilt and regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As players move through these dreamlike spaces, they uncover hidden truths about the relationship between a granddaughter and her grandfather, slowly piecing together the events that led to a devastating loss. With every step deeper into memory, the question grows heavier:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/c00fe4c6598924e29bc9e01212dd2703.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/16bc056ad32add86656446ef273f6589.poster.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/16bc056ad32add86656446ef273f6589.webm?t=1782406632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey into the darkest memories of Nala, looking for a way to erase the trauma and regret through an experimental treatment. The Flower will guide you through to what you may need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/eca5de6a75257ed078404a20e6f532a5.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/2ec67e32c2c007417b8f79be05fa1bec.poster.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/2ec67e32c2c007417b8f79be05fa1bec.webm?t=1782406632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two sides to every coin. Two sides to every memory. Journey through shared memories of Nala and her late grandfather, piecing together the truth of what happened between them, the joy, the sorrow, and everything in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/ce8c52be8f754993a968ad9ad5b9ba66.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/d3cea6f30b64355da3a8c984f1e7069f.poster.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/d3cea6f30b64355da3a8c984f1e7069f.webm?t=1782406632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do you fix regret? How much will it take? The pieced-together truth may provide the solution. Or it might push Nala even further into despair, grappling with her guilt. The only way to know is to test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/2cf3d23b49f49f077d726f4c6856298c.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/af5c0b900368852093e2a9baa2212d91.poster.avif?t=1782406632\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/extras/af5c0b900368852093e2a9baa2212d91.webm?t=1782406632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test. Test. Then test again. Change the variables. Change the answers. Find a way to erase the regret. Eventually.</p>", "short_description": "Would you forgive yourself if you killed someone you love? Enter the traumatic memories of The Flower, experience death as the killer and the killed, and submerge yourself in a dark, interactive adventure of emotions, suffering, and regret - looking for a way to forget.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/79ac1f7cd257a18964c80946e082727b33dd6511/header.jpg?t=1782406632", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/a4520bb44871e7724f636c1fbc19e20dd8b6f8fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782406632", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180670/a4520bb44871e7724f636c1fbc19e20dd8b6f8fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782406632", "website": "https://www.undyingflower.calcatz.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 8thGen (Mobile)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1050Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum: